#: code:addons/mass_mailing/static/src/snippets/mass_mailing_headings_snippets.xml:0
msgid ""
", I've focused on creating elegant, user-centric designs that are both "
"scalable and easy to maintain."
msgstr ""
", ຂ້າພະເຈົ້າໄດ້ສຸມໃສ່ການສ້າງການອອກແບບທີ່ສວຍງາມ, ເນັ້ນຜູ້ໃຊ້ເປັນໃຈກາງ ເຊິ່ງສາມາດຂະຫຍາຍໄດ້ ແລະ ດູແ"
"ລຮັກສາງ່າຍ."

#. module: mass_mailing
#. odoo-javascript
#: code:addons/mass_mailing/static/src/snippets/mass_mailing_headings_snippets.xml:0
msgid ""
", a design expert specializing in responsive web and mobile app interfaces."
msgstr ""
", ຜູ້ຊ່ຽວຊານດ້ານການອອກແບບໜ້າຕາເວັບໄຊ ແລະ ແອັບມືຖືທີ່ຮອງຮັບທຸກຂະໜາດໜ້າຈໍ."

#. module: mass_mailing
#. odoo-javascript
#: code:addons/mass_mailing/static/src/snippets/mass_mailing_images_snippets.xml:0
msgid ""
", ensuring that your interior reflects a sophisticated yet inviting "
"atmosphere."
msgstr ""
", ເພື່ອຮັບປະກັນວ່າພາຍໃນເຮືອນຂອງທ່ານສະທ້ອນເຖິງບັນຍາກາດທີ່ຫຼູຫຼາແຕ່ອົບອຸ່ນໜ້າຢູ່."

#. module: mass_mailing
#. odoo-javascript
#: code:addons/mass_mailing/static/src/snippets/mass_mailing_images_snippets.xml:0
msgid ""
", turning every corner of your home into a sanctuary of happiness and ease."
msgstr ", ປ່ຽນທຸກມຸມຂອງເຮືອນທ່ານໃຫ້ກາຍເປັນສະຖານທີ່ແຫ່ງຄວາມສຸກ ແລະ ຄວາມສະບາຍໃຈ."

#. module: mass_mailing
#. odoo-javascript
#: code:addons/mass_mailing/static/src/snippets/mass_mailing_columns_snippets.xml:0
msgid ""
". Choose an image or a color for the background. You can even resize and "
"duplicate the blocks to create your own layout. Add images or icons to "
"customize the blocks."
msgstr ""
". ເລືອກຮູບພາບ ຫຼື ສີສຳລັບພື້ນຫຼັງ. ທ່ານຍັງສາມາດປັບຂະໜາດ ແລະ ສຳເນົາບລັອກເພື່ອສ້າງຮູບແບບຂອງທ່ານເອງໄ"
"ດ້. ເພີ່ມຮູບພາບ ຫຼື ໄອຄອນເພື່ອປັບແຕ່ງບລັອກຕາມໃຈ."

#. module: mass_mailing
#. odoo-javascript
#: code:addons/mass_mailing/static/src/snippets/mass_mailing_website_snippets.xml:0
msgid ". Complimentary care packs included with every sofa."
msgstr ". ຊຸດອຸປະກອນດູແລຮັກສາຟຣີມາພ້ອມກັບໂຊຟາທຸກໆໂຕ."

#. module: mass_mailing
#. odoo-javascript
#: code:addons/mass_mailing/static/src/snippets/mass_mailing_text_snippets.xml:0
msgid ""
". Consider telling a great story that provides personality. Writing a story "
"with personality for potential clients will assist with making a "
"relationship connection. This shows up in small quirks like word choices or "
"phrases. Write from your point of view, not from someone else's experience."
msgstr ""
". ລອງເລົ່າເລື່ອງລາວທີ່ດີເພື່ອສະແດງໃຫ້ເຫັນຕົວຕົນຂອງທ່ານ. ການຂຽນເລື່ອງລາວທີ່ມີເອກະລັກສຳລັບລູກຄ້າຈະຊ່ວຍສ້"
"າງສາຍສຳພັນທີ່ດີ. ສິ່ງນີ້ສະແດງອອກຜ່ານລາຍລະອຽດເລັກໆນ້ອຍໆ ເຊັ່ນ: ການເລືອກໃຊ້ຄຳສັບ ຫຼື ວະລີ. ຂຽນຈາກມຸ"
"ມມອງຂອງທ່ານເອງ ບໍ່ແມ່ນຈາກປະສົບການຂອງຄົນອື່ນ."

#. module: mass_mailing
#. odoo-javascript
#: code:addons/mass_mailing/static/src/snippets/mass_mailing_text_snippets.xml:0
msgid ""
". If you try to write with a wide, general audience in mind, your story will "
"sound fake and lack emotion. No one will be interested. Write for one "
"person. If it's genuine for the one, it's genuine for the rest."
msgstr ""
". ຖ້າທ່ານພະຍາຍາມຂຽນໃຫ້ກວມລວມຄົນທຸກກຸ່ມ, ເລື່ອງລາວຂອງທ່ານຈະຟັງຄືບໍ່ຈິງໃຈ ແລະ ຂາດອາລົມຄວາມຮູ້ສຶກ. "
"ຈະບໍ່ມີໃຜສົນໃຈ. ຈົ່ງຂຽນໂດຍຄິດເຖິງຄົນພຽງຄົນດຽວ. ຖ້າມັນຈິງໃຈສຳລັບຄົນໆນັ້ນ, ມັນກໍຈະຈິງໃຈສຳລັບຄົນອື່ນໆເຊັ່ນ"
"ກັນ."

#. module: mass_mailing
#. odoo-javascript
#: code:addons/mass_mailing/static/src/snippets/mass_mailing_marketing_snippets.xml:0
msgid "/ month"
msgstr "/ ເດືອນ"

